  "title": "Oceaneering Secures Multi-Year Inspection Contract Extension in Norway",
  "summary": "Houston – Oceaneering International, Inc. announced that its Integrity Management and Digital Solutions (IMDS) business has secured a four-year extension to its inspection support contract for multiple Equinor assets in Norway. The extension period began on January 1, 2026. The scope includes In-Service Inspection, Non-Destructive Testing (NDT), Advanced NDT, Rope Access, and the provision of",
